":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"48"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the chuuni girls, Spica believes to have come from space in order to monitor and observe the earthlings... or this is what she says, while spending her days as a normal high school girl. She doesn't show many emotions but can still hold decent conversations with people. Despite disliking violence, she loves to think about the destruction of Earth just in case the earthlings start acting weird."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c27955"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"地球人を監視するため、宇宙からやって来た「観測者」……という設定で日々をマイペースに過ごす、地球生まれの女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口で感情を全く表に出さず、人とのコミュニケーションも最低限の会話で済ませる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物事の好き嫌いが激しく、気にくわないことがあるとすぐに地球を滅ぼそうとする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6263","sourceWorkId":"21407","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"地球人を監視するため、宇宙からやって来た “観測者”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"……という設定で日々をマイペースに過ごす、地球生まれの女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口で感情をまったく表に出さず、人とのコミュニケーションも最低限の会話で済ませる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物事の好き嫌いが激しく、気にくわないことがあるとすぐに地球を滅ぼそうとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「見て……あれが、すぴかの生まれた星……」 （※地球生まれ）"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"34975"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"67 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6263","sourceWorkId":"21407","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"150 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6263","sourceWorkId":"21407","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"73 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6263","sourceWorkId":"21407","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"48 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"6263","sourceWorkId":"21407","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/te